cdomain\/zero\/1.0\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC0 1.0<\/a><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>Can use \u2018|\u2019 instead of \u2018\/\u2019.<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Replace all &lt;prev&gt; with &lt;new&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>\u2018s\/&lt;prev&gt;\/&lt;new&gt;\/[g]\u2019 &lt;input_file&gt; &gt; &lt;output_file&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCan use \u2018|\u2019 instead of \u2018\/\u2019.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>i<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tInplace.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tReplace and save the same file.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tBackup is created if extension is supplied.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>e<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>script - additional commands to be executed<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Multiple<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Multiple -e \u2018s\/&lt;prev_1&gt;\/&lt;new_1&gt;\/g\u2019 -e \u2018s\/&lt;prev_2&gt;\/&lt;new_2&gt;\/g\u2019<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>'&lt;n&gt;d'<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDeletes nth line.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Escape<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>\/\\\/ &gt; \\<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Replace with new line<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>echo \"a,b\" | sed -e $'s\/,\/\\\\\\n\/g'<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/sed\/notes\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/sed\/notes\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/d